# Copy this file to .env.local and fill it in. .env.local is git-ignored: never commit a real key.
#
# Get a key at https://console.anthropic.com/ (see "Getting an API key" in the README or the
# Setup page). Use a key made just for this project, and give it a low spend limit.
# Never add NEXT_PUBLIC_ to the name: that would send the key to every visitor's browser.
# On a Mac you can skip this file entirely: run `npm run dev:key`. It asks for the key once and
# saves it in your Keychain (see "Storing the local key on a Mac" in the README).
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Optional: a different Claude model. Defaults to the one in lib/config.ts.
# MODEL=claude-haiku-5-5

# History (production only: nothing below is read in development or preview, and no database
# connection is ever opened there). Set these in the Vercel project, never in a committed file.
# HISTORY_DATABASE_URL is the history_app role (INSERT, SELECT); HISTORY_PURGE_DATABASE_URL is the
# history_purge role (SELECT, DELETE), used only by the daily clean-up. CRON_SECRET is the secret the
# clean-up route checks in its Authorization header.
HISTORY_DATABASE_URL=
HISTORY_PURGE_DATABASE_URL=
CRON_SECRET=
